## 5. Worked exemplars

### [CXC-IM-EXEMPLARS] Worked classifications of real ComposePlatform cases

- bsg-world: `compose_projects/bsg/world` = APPLICATION (Q0) -> the COMPLEX/standalone end of [CXC-IM-APP-AUTHORSHIP-AXIS]'s spectrum — a structural simulation exceeding natural declarative expression. Its crisis-escalation rules are structured Python today, with a planned expression-DSL swap for the more AUTHORABLE rules — the live code<->config boundary the axis describes.
- house-home-assistant-replacement: a house modeled as a Home-Assistant replacement = APPLICATION (Q0) -> the DECLARATIVE/state-manager-config end of [CXC-IM-APP-AUTHORSHIP-AXIS]'s spectrum ([CXC-IM-MODEL-STATE-MANAGER-CONFIG]) — state_manager's FOUNDING use-case (David, 2026-09-12): the whole application realized as config/rules, no dedicated process, no code.
- simple-game: a simple ComposeIO-based game = APPLICATION (Q0) -> also the DECLARATIVE/state-manager-config end — David's own example (2026-09-12) of a use-case where "the existing tool set is more than sufficient" without a standalone process.
- no-bright-line: bsg-world and the house/simple-game exemplars are ALL applications; the spectrum in [CXC-IM-APP-AUTHORSHIP-AXIS] plus the author's own use-case, complexity, skill, and agentic-AI context place a given application along it — there is no bright line separating "a config" from "an app", per [CXC-IM-APP-GUIDANCE-IS-DESCRIPTIVE].
- fingerprint-pipeline: fingerprint_template_store and the fingerprint-enrollment pipeline = CAPABILITY (Q0) -> rung 5 of [CXC-IM-SERVICE-RUBRIC] -> ComposeServer plugin.
- coordination-relay: coordination_relay = CAPABILITY that spans multiple tenants -> fails the plugin's per-tenant invariant -> fallback-to-standalone in [CXC-IM-SERVICE-RUBRIC].
- time-and-freshness: time_service / storage_monitor = CAPABILITY (Q0) -> rung 5 of [CXC-IM-SERVICE-RUBRIC] -> ComposeServer plugin (time ships as a default plugin per the grounded node).
- status: proposed
- provenance: architect-synthesis for the capability classifications (fingerprint-pipeline, coordination-relay, time-and-freshness) and for bsg-world's placement at the spectrum's complex end; only bsg-world's underlying Q0 classification traces directly to David's pushback recorded in [CXC-IM-Q0-APP-VS-CAPABILITY]. david-stated for house-home-assistant-replacement and simple-game — both are David's own examples, 2026-09-12, of the declarative end.
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-INTEGRATION-MODELS]
- see-also: [CXC-IM-SERVICE-RUBRIC], [CXC-IM-APP-AUTHORSHIP-AXIS], [CXC-IM-MODEL-STATE-MANAGER-CONFIG], [CXC-IM-APP-GUIDANCE-IS-DESCRIPTIVE], [CXC-CS-DEFAULT-PLUGINS]

